# Agency knowledge base

## Source of truth

- Catalog: `docs/agency-pages-and-journeys.md`
- Flow map (browser): `docs/visuals/agency-pages-and-journeys.html`
- UML sequences (browser): `docs/visuals/agency-journeys-sequence.html`
- Index: `docs/README.md` · root `README.md` · `AGENTS.md`

## When to open the catalog

Read the catalog **only if** the task needs a page, route, menu item, or end-to-end journey. Do not load it for unrelated code edits.

## Mini route map

| Area | Route |
|---|---|
| New trip | `/Home`, `/TaxiTrips` |
| Book | `/Reserve/*` |
| Tickets | `/TicketInfo` |
| Invoices | `/OfficialInvoices` |
| Profile / charge | `/Agency`, `/Agency#balance` |
| Members | `/Employees` |
| Reports | `/Analytics` |
| Auth / register | `/Auth/*`, `/CreateAccount` |

## After changing a journey

Update `docs/agency-pages-and-journeys.md` and the flowchart + sequence visuals in the same change.
